-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(148,NULL,'Reasoning','रीजनिंग','reasoning',1,NULL,'fa fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece','Reasoning Questions & Quiz for Competitive Exams | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice reasoning questions on syllogism, seating arrangement, coding-decoding, blood relations, direction sense and more.',NULL,'reasoning questions, reasoning quiz, logical reasoning questions, reasoning practice questions',NULL,'Reasoning Questions & Online Practice',NULL,'Improve your logical reasoning skills with topic-based questions and quizzes. Practise common areas such as syllogism, seating arrangement, coding-decoding, blood relations, direction sense and number series.',NULL,'<h2>Reasoning Practice for Competitive Exams</h2>\r\n<p>Reasoning questions test your ability to identify patterns, relationships and logical connections. Regular practice can help you become more familiar with different question types and improve your accuracy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Practice Common Reasoning Topics</h2>\r\n<p>QuizMitra includes reasoning practice across topics such as syllogism, seating arrangement, coding-decoding, blood relations, direction sense and number series. Start with the topic you are studying and use the quiz results to guide your next revision.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Useful for SSC, Banking and Railway Exams</h2>\r\n<p>Reasoning forms an important part of several competitive examinations. Topic-wise practice allows you to focus on one question type at a time before moving towards mixed practice.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Accuracy Matters</h2>\r\n<p>Try to understand the method behind an answer rather than simply remembering the correct option. When you get a question wrong, review the explanation and attempt similar questions again later.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Build Reasoning Skills Through Regular Practice</h2>\r\n<p>Choose one reasoning topic, practise a set of questions and review your mistakes before moving to another topic. Consistency can make your preparation more effective than occasional long practice sessions.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning','Reasoning Questions & Quiz for Competitive Exams | QuizMitra','Practise reasoning questions covering syllogism, seating arrangement, coding-decoding, blood relations and more.',NULL,'Reasoning Questions & Quiz | QuizMitra','Improve logical reasoning with topic-wise questions and online practice quizzes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 17:43:22','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(149,148,'Verbal Reasoning','वर्बल रीजनिंग','verbal-reasoning',1,NULL,'fas fa-comments','Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice verbal reasoning questions covering logical statements, word based problems, relationships, sequences and reasoning concepts.',NULL,'verbal reasoning quiz, verbal reasoning questions, verbal reasoning test, verbal ability reasoning',NULL,'Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions',NULL,'Test your verbal reasoning skills with questions that require careful reading, logical thinking and the ability to identify relationships between words and statements.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Verbal Reasoning Questions</h2><p>Verbal reasoning tests how well you can understand information presented through words and identify logical relationships. Regular question practice can improve accuracy and confidence.</p><h2>Types of Verbal Reasoning Questions</h2><p>Practice may include word relationships, statements, logical comparisons, sequences and other language based reasoning problems.</p><h2>Improve Accuracy Through Practice</h2><p>Read each question carefully before choosing an answer. When you make a mistake, review the relationship or rule used to solve the question.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Build Strong Verbal Reasoning Skills</h2><p>Regular practice with different question patterns can help you recognise relationships faster during competitive examinations.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/verbal-reasoning','Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions | QuizMitra','Practice verbal reasoning questions and improve logical thinking through online quizzes.',NULL,'Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions | QuizMitra','Test your verbal reasoning skills with online practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(150,148,'Non-Verbal Reasoning','नॉन-वर्बल रीजनिंग','non-verbal-reasoning',1,NULL,'fas fa-shapes','Non Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice non verbal reasoning questions based on figures, patterns, shapes, series, visual relationships and logical problem solving.',NULL,'non verbal reasoning quiz, non verbal reasoning questions, figure reasoning test, non verbal reasoning practice',NULL,'Non Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions',NULL,'Improve visual reasoning skills with questions based on shapes, figures, patterns and relationships. Practice identifying changes and logical arrangements through quizzes.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Non Verbal Reasoning</h2><p>Non verbal reasoning uses figures, shapes and visual patterns instead of relying mainly on words. It is commonly used to test observation and logical thinking.</p><h2>Figures, Patterns and Relationships</h2><p>Questions can involve identifying the next figure, finding a missing pattern, comparing shapes or recognising a visual relationship.</p><h2>Develop Observation Skills</h2><p>Look for changes in direction, position, number, shape and arrangement. Practising different patterns can make unfamiliar questions easier to approach.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Visual Reasoning Ability</h2><p>Use regular practice to become familiar with different figure based patterns and improve the speed of visual analysis.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/non-verbal-reasoning','Non Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions | QuizMitra','Practice figure, pattern and visual reasoning questions with online quizzes.',NULL,'Non Verbal Reasoning Quiz & Questions | QuizMitra','Test your visual and non verbal reasoning skills online.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(151,148,'Logical Reasoning','लॉजिकल रीजनिंग','logical-reasoning',1,NULL,'fas fa-brain','Logical Reasoning Quiz & Questions | Practice Test | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice logical reasoning questions covering statements, conclusions, relationships, patterns and analytical problem solving.',NULL,'logical reasoning quiz, logical reasoning questions, logical reasoning test, reasoning practice',NULL,'Logical Reasoning Quiz & Questions',NULL,'Test your ability to analyse information and reach logical conclusions with practice questions covering common reasoning patterns and problems.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Logical Reasoning Questions</h2><p>Logical reasoning focuses on analysing information and using rules or relationships to reach a conclusion. Regular practice helps learners become familiar with common question patterns.</p><h2>Important Logical Reasoning Topics</h2><p>Questions may involve statements, conclusions, relationships, classifications, sequences and other analytical problems.</p><h2>Think Before You Answer</h2><p>Focus on the information given in the question rather than making assumptions. Checking each condition can help reduce avoidable mistakes.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Build Better Logical Reasoning Skills</h2><p>Practise different question types regularly and review the reasoning behind incorrect answers to improve accuracy.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/logical-reasoning','Logical Reasoning Quiz & Questions | Practice Test | QuizMitra','Practice logical reasoning problems and test your analytical thinking skills online.',NULL,'Logical Reasoning Quiz & Questions | Practice Test | QuizMitra','Improve logical reasoning with focused online practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(152,148,'Number Series','संख्या श्रृंखला','number-series',1,NULL,'fas fa-sort-numeric-up','Number Series Questions & Quiz | Reasoning Practice | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice number series questions based on patterns, differences, multiplication, division and other numerical relationships.',NULL,'number series questions, number series quiz, number series reasoning, number series practice',NULL,'Number Series Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Practise number series questions by identifying the pattern connecting a sequence of numbers. Improve speed by learning to spot common numerical relationships.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Number Series Questions</h2><p>Number series questions require you to identify the rule or pattern connecting a sequence of numbers. The missing or next number can then be found using that relationship.</p><h2>Common Number Patterns</h2><p>Patterns may involve addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, alternating operations, differences or combinations of these methods.</p><h2>Improve Series Solving Speed</h2><p>Start by checking simple differences and ratios before considering more complicated patterns. Regular practice makes common patterns easier to recognise.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Strengthen Number Series Reasoning</h2><p>Practise different difficulty levels and review the method used for each answer. This can help improve both accuracy and solving speed.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/number-series','Number Series Questions & Quiz | Reasoning Practice | QuizMitra','Solve number series questions and practise numerical reasoning patterns online.',NULL,'Number Series Questions & Quiz | QuizMitra','Practice number series reasoning questions and improve pattern recognition.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(153,148,'Alphabet Series','अक्षर श्रृंखला','alphabet-series',1,NULL,'fas fa-sort-alpha-up','Alphabet Series Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice alphabet series questions based on letter positions, sequences, patterns and logical relationships for reasoning exams.',NULL,'alphabet series questions, alphabet series quiz, alphabet reasoning questions, alphabet test',NULL,'Alphabet Series Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Test your ability to identify patterns in alphabet sequences. Practice questions based on letter positions, forward and backward movement and changing patterns.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Alphabet Series Questions</h2><p>Alphabet series problems use the positions and relationships between letters to create a sequence. Finding the underlying pattern is the key to solving these questions.</p><h2>Letter Positions and Patterns</h2><p>Questions can involve forward or backward letter movement, alternate positions, groups of letters and combinations of different patterns.</p><h2>Improve Pattern Recognition</h2><p>Convert letters into their positions when necessary and compare the changes between consecutive terms. This can make complicated sequences easier to analyse.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Get Faster at Alphabet Reasoning</h2><p>Regular practice with different alphabet patterns can improve speed and accuracy in reasoning sections of competitive exams.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/alphabet-series','Alphabet Series Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice alphabet series and letter pattern questions for reasoning preparation.',NULL,'Alphabet Series Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your alphabet reasoning skills with online practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(154,148,'Coding-Decoding','कोडिंग-डिकोडिंग','coding-decoding',1,NULL,'fas fa-code','Coding Decoding Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice coding decoding questions based on letter, number and word patterns with reasoning quizzes for competitive exams.',NULL,'coding decoding questions, coding decoding quiz, coding decoding reasoning, coding decoding practice',NULL,'Coding Decoding Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Practice coding decoding problems where letters, numbers or words are transformed according to a hidden rule. Learn to identify the pattern and apply it accurately.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Coding Decoding Questions</h2><p>Coding decoding questions provide information about how a word, letter or number has been transformed and ask you to apply the same rule to another example.</p><h2>Common Coding Patterns</h2><p>Problems may use alphabet positions, letter shifts, reverse arrangements, substitutions or numerical relationships. Identifying the exact rule is more important than guessing from the options.</p><h2>Improve Coding Decoding Accuracy</h2><p>Work through the given examples step by step and verify the rule against every part of the question before selecting an answer.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Master Coding Decoding Practice</h2><p>Regular practice with different coding patterns can make these questions quicker to solve during SSC, banking, railway and other reasoning examinations.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/coding-decoding','Coding Decoding Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Solve coding decoding reasoning questions and practise different coding patterns online.',NULL,'Coding Decoding Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice coding decoding questions for competitive exam reasoning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(155,148,'Blood Relations','रक्त संबंध','blood-relations',1,NULL,'fas fa-users','Blood Relation Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice blood relation reasoning questions involving family relationships, generations and family tree based problems.',NULL,'blood relation questions, blood relation quiz, blood relation reasoning, family relation questions',NULL,'Blood Relation Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Test your ability to understand family relationships through blood relation questions. Practise family tree problems and identify relationships step by step.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Blood Relation Questions</h2><p>Blood relation problems require you to understand relationships between different members of a family. Drawing a simple family tree can often make the relationships easier to follow.</p><h2>Family Tree and Generations</h2><p>Questions may involve parents, siblings, children, grandparents, uncles, aunts and other family relationships across different generations.</p><h2>Solve Relationships Step by Step</h2><p>Start from the person mentioned in the question and follow each relationship carefully. Avoid making assumptions about relationships that have not been stated.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Blood Relation Reasoning</h2><p>Practise different family structures regularly to become faster at identifying relationships in competitive examination questions.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/blood-relations','Blood Relation Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice family relationship and blood relation reasoning questions online.',NULL,'Blood Relation Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your blood relation reasoning skills with practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(156,148,'Direction Sense','दिशा ज्ञान','direction-sense',1,NULL,'fas fa-compass','Direction Sense Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice direction sense questions involving north, south, east, west, turns, distances and position based reasoning.',NULL,'direction sense questions, direction sense test, direction reasoning quiz, direction distance questions',NULL,'Direction Sense Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Practise direction and distance reasoning questions involving turns, positions and movement. Learn to track directions accurately from the information given.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Direction Sense Questions</h2><p>Direction sense problems ask you to determine the final position or direction after a person moves through a series of turns and distances.</p><h2>Use Directions Carefully</h2><p>North, south, east and west form the basic reference points. Drawing a quick diagram can help when a question contains several movements.</p><h2>Direction and Distance Practice</h2><p>Pay attention to every turn and the direction in which movement occurs. Keep the starting position clear while solving the problem.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Direction Reasoning Speed</h2><p>Regular practice with movement and distance problems can make direction sense questions easier to solve under time pressure.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/direction-sense','Direction Sense Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Solve direction and distance reasoning questions with online practice quizzes.',NULL,'Direction Sense Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice direction sense and distance based reasoning problems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(157,148,'Analogy','एनालॉजी','analogy',1,NULL,'fas fa-equals','Analogy Questions & Quiz | Reasoning Practice | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice analogy reasoning questions based on relationships between words, numbers, letters and concepts.',NULL,'analogy questions, analogy quiz, reasoning analogy questions, analogy reasoning test',NULL,'Analogy Questions & Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Test your ability to identify relationships between words, numbers, letters and concepts through analogy based reasoning questions.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Analogy Questions</h2><p>Analogy questions present a relationship between two items and ask you to find another pair with the same relationship. Identifying the exact connection is the key.</p><h2>Word, Number and Letter Analogies</h2><p>Analogy problems can use meanings, functions, categories, numerical operations, letter positions or other logical relationships.</p><h2>Find the Relationship First</h2><p>Before looking closely at the answer choices, determine what connects the first pair. Then apply the same relationship to the second pair.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Analogy Reasoning</h2><p>Practice different analogy patterns regularly to improve your ability to identify relationships quickly and accurately.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/analogy','Analogy Questions & Quiz | Reasoning Practice | QuizMitra','Practice word, number and letter analogy reasoning questions online.',NULL,'Analogy Questions & Quiz | Reasoning Practice | QuizMitra','Test your analogy reasoning skills with focused practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(158,148,'Classification','वर्गीकरण','classification',1,NULL,'fas fa-sitemap','Classification Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice classification reasoning questions where you identify the odd item or group items according to a common property.',NULL,'classification questions, classification reasoning quiz, odd one out questions, classification test',NULL,'Classification Questions & Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Practise classification and odd one out questions by identifying the common relationship among items and finding the one that does not belong.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Classification Questions</h2><p>Classification questions ask you to group related items or identify an item that differs from the others according to a logical property.</p><h2>Find the Common Rule</h2><p>The relationship may be based on numbers, letters, words, objects, categories or other characteristics. Look for the strongest common property shared by the majority.</p><h2>Improve Observation and Logic</h2><p>Do not choose an answer simply because it looks different. Identify the exact rule that separates one option from the remaining items.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Get Better at Odd One Out Questions</h2><p>Regular classification practice can improve observation and logical comparison skills used in competitive reasoning tests.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/classification','Classification Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Solve classification and odd one out reasoning questions through online quizzes.',NULL,'Classification Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice classification and odd one out reasoning questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(159,148,'Ranking','रैंकिंग','ranking',1,NULL,'fas fa-trophy','Ranking Questions & Quiz | Order and Position Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice ranking and order questions involving positions, ranks, people, scores and arrangements in reasoning tests.',NULL,'ranking questions, ranking reasoning quiz, order and ranking questions, position reasoning',NULL,'Ranking Questions & Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Practice ranking and position questions involving people, scores, heights and order. Learn to calculate positions from the information provided.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Ranking Questions</h2><p>Ranking problems ask you to determine the position of a person or object within an ordered group. Careful interpretation of the given ranks is important.</p><h2>Order and Position Problems</h2><p>Questions may provide ranks from the top or bottom, positions from either side, or information about people between two positions.</p><h2>Use Simple Position Logic</h2><p>Write down the known positions and calculate the missing information step by step. This reduces mistakes when several rankings are mentioned.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Ranking Question Accuracy</h2><p>Practise different position and ordering patterns to become faster at solving ranking questions during timed examinations.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/ranking','Ranking Questions & Quiz | Order and Position Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice ranking, order and position based reasoning questions online.',NULL,'Ranking Questions & Quiz | Order and Position Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your ranking and position reasoning skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:16','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(160,148,'Syllogism','सिलॉजिज़्म','syllogism',1,NULL,'fas fa-project-diagram','Syllogism Questions & Quiz | Logical Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice syllogism questions involving statements, conclusions, logical relationships and Venn diagram based reasoning.',NULL,'syllogism questions, syllogism quiz, syllogism reasoning, syllogism practice questions',NULL,'Syllogism Questions & Logical Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Test your ability to draw valid conclusions from given statements with syllogism reasoning questions and practice quizzes.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Syllogism Questions</h2><p>Syllogism problems provide statements and ask you to determine which conclusions logically follow from them. The conclusion must be based only on the information given.</p><h2>Statements and Conclusions</h2><p>Questions commonly use relationships such as all, some and none. Representing the statements visually can make certain problems easier to analyse.</p><h2>Focus on Logical Validity</h2><p>A conclusion should follow from the given statements rather than from general knowledge. Check every conclusion against the complete set of conditions.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Syllogism Accuracy</h2><p>Regular practice with different statement patterns can help you recognise logical relationships and solve syllogism questions more confidently.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/syllogism','Syllogism Questions & Quiz | Logical Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice syllogism statements and conclusions with logical reasoning quizzes.',NULL,'Syllogism Questions & Quiz | Logical Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your syllogism reasoning skills with practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(161,148,'Statement & Conclusion','कथन और निष्कर्ष','statement-conclusion',1,NULL,'fas fa-check-double','Statement and Conclusion Questions | Reasoning Quiz | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice statement and conclusion reasoning questions by analysing given information and identifying conclusions that logically follow.',NULL,'statement conclusion questions, statement and conclusion quiz, reasoning conclusions, statement reasoning questions',NULL,'Statement and Conclusion Questions',NULL,'Practise questions that require you to analyse a statement and decide which conclusion logically follows from the information provided.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Statement and Conclusion Questions</h2><p>These reasoning questions test whether a conclusion can logically be drawn from a given statement. The answer should depend on the information in the question.</p><h2>Analyse the Given Information</h2><p>Read the statement carefully and separate what is directly supported from what is merely possible or assumed. Then check each conclusion independently.</p><h2>Avoid Unstated Assumptions</h2><p>One common mistake is using outside knowledge that is not contained in the statement. Focus on the logical connection between the given information and the conclusion.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Statement Based Reasoning</h2><p>Regular practice can help you identify valid conclusions more quickly and improve accuracy in competitive examination reasoning sections.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/statement-conclusion','Statement and Conclusion Questions | Reasoning Quiz | QuizMitra','Solve statement and conclusion reasoning questions through focused online practice.',NULL,'Statement and Conclusion Questions | Reasoning Quiz | QuizMitra','Practice logical statement and conclusion questions online.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:58','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(162,148,'Seating Arrangement','बैठक व्यवस्था','seating-arrangement',1,NULL,'fas fa-chair','Seating Arrangement Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice seating arrangement questions involving rows, circles, positions, neighbours and logical arrangement problems.',NULL,'seating arrangement questions, seating arrangement quiz, seating arrangement reasoning, circular seating questions',NULL,'Seating Arrangement Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Practice seating arrangement problems involving rows, circles and positions. Learn to organise clues and determine where each person or object belongs.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Seating Arrangement Questions</h2><p>Seating arrangement questions provide several clues about the positions of people or objects. The challenge is to combine those clues into one consistent arrangement.</p><h2>Linear and Circular Arrangements</h2><p>Problems may involve people sitting in a row, around a circle or in another defined arrangement. Direction and neighbour relationships are especially important in circular questions.</p><h2>Build the Arrangement Step by Step</h2><p>Start with the strongest or fixed clue and gradually place the remaining information. A simple diagram can make complex arrangements much easier to manage.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Seating Arrangement Speed</h2><p>Practise both linear and circular arrangements regularly. With experience, you can identify useful clues faster and reduce unnecessary trial and error.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/seating-arrangement','Seating Arrangement Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice linear and circular seating arrangement reasoning questions online.',NULL,'Seating Arrangement Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your seating arrangement reasoning skills with practice quizzes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(163,148,'Puzzle','पज़ल','puzzle',1,NULL,'fas fa-puzzle-piece','Reasoning Puzzle Questions & Quiz | Logical Puzzles | QuizMitra',NULL,'Solve reasoning puzzle questions involving arrangements, schedules, conditions, people, objects and logical problem solving.',NULL,'reasoning puzzles, puzzle questions, reasoning puzzle quiz, logical puzzle questions',NULL,'Reasoning Puzzle Questions & Quiz',NULL,'Challenge your logical thinking with reasoning puzzles based on arrangements, conditions, schedules and relationships. Practise solving multi-step problems systematically.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Reasoning Puzzle Questions</h2><p>Reasoning puzzles combine several clues and require you to find an arrangement or answer that satisfies all the conditions. They are useful for developing structured problem solving.</p><h2>Common Puzzle Patterns</h2><p>Puzzles can involve people, places, schedules, rankings, objects, selections and different types of arrangements.</p><h2>Solve Complex Problems Systematically</h2><p>Write down the clues and use a table or diagram when appropriate. Eliminate possibilities that conflict with the conditions instead of guessing.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Build Strong Puzzle Solving Skills</h2><p>Start with manageable puzzles and gradually attempt more complex sets. Reviewing the solution method is useful even when your final answer is correct.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/puzzle','Reasoning Puzzle Questions & Quiz | Logical Puzzles | QuizMitra','Solve logical reasoning puzzles based on arrangements, conditions and relationships.',NULL,'Reasoning Puzzle Questions & Quiz | Logical Puzzles | QuizMitra','Challenge your reasoning skills with online puzzle practice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(164,148,'Calendar','कैलेंडर','calendar',1,NULL,'fas fa-calendar-alt','Calendar Questions & Quiz | Calendar Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice calendar reasoning questions involving days, dates, leap years, odd days and finding the day of the week.',NULL,'calendar questions, calendar reasoning quiz, calendar problems, calendar aptitude questions',NULL,'Calendar Questions & Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Practice calendar based reasoning questions involving dates, days, leap years and day calculations. Improve your ability to determine the correct day from given information.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Calendar Questions</h2><p>Calendar reasoning questions require you to connect dates with days of the week. Understanding how ordinary years and leap years affect the calendar is important.</p><h2>Days, Dates and Leap Years</h2><p>Questions may ask you to find the day for a particular date, calculate the difference between dates or determine how the calendar changes across years.</p><h2>Use a Clear Calculation Method</h2><p>Keep track of the number of days and apply the appropriate rule for leap years. Writing intermediate steps can help prevent calculation errors.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Calendar Reasoning</h2><p>Regular practice with different dates and year combinations can make calendar questions faster and more reliable.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/calendar','Calendar Questions & Quiz | Calendar Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice calendar reasoning questions about days, dates and leap years.',NULL,'Calendar Questions & Quiz | Calendar Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your calendar reasoning skills with online practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(165,148,'Clock','घड़ी','clock',1,NULL,'fas fa-clock','Clock Questions & Quiz | Clock Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice clock reasoning questions involving angles, hands, time, mirror images and clock based aptitude problems.',NULL,'clock questions, clock reasoning quiz, clock aptitude questions, clock problems',NULL,'Clock Questions & Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Test your clock reasoning skills with questions involving time, angles between hands, positions of clock hands and common clock problems.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Clock Reasoning Questions</h2><p>Clock problems use the relative movement of the hour and minute hands to create questions about angles, positions and time.</p><h2>Angles and Clock Hands</h2><p>Understanding how quickly each hand moves is important when solving angle based questions. Some problems may also involve mirror images or unusual clock positions.</p><h2>Work Through the Calculation</h2><p>Keep the hour and minute positions separate when needed and carefully interpret what the question is asking before calculating the answer.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Clock Question Accuracy</h2><p>Practise different clock patterns regularly so that common angle and time calculations become more familiar.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/clock','Clock Questions & Quiz | Clock Reasoning | QuizMitra','Solve clock reasoning questions involving time, angles and clock hand positions.',NULL,'Clock Questions & Quiz | Clock Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice clock aptitude and reasoning questions online.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(166,148,'Venn Diagram','वेन आरेख','venn-diagram',1,NULL,'fas fa-circle-notch','Venn Diagram Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice Venn diagram reasoning questions involving sets, groups, common elements and logical relationships.',NULL,'Venn diagram questions, Venn diagram quiz, Venn diagram reasoning, set reasoning questions',NULL,'Venn Diagram Questions & Reasoning Quiz',NULL,'Practice Venn diagram questions that use circles and overlapping groups to represent relationships between different sets or categories.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Venn Diagram Questions</h2><p>Venn diagrams provide a visual way to represent relationships between groups. Reasoning questions often use overlapping circles to show common and separate elements.</p><h2>Understand Sets and Overlap</h2><p>Questions may ask about items belonging to one group, multiple groups or none of the groups. Carefully identifying the overlap is essential.</p><h2>Use Diagrams to Simplify Problems</h2><p>Convert the information from the question into a simple diagram before calculating the required value. A clear representation can make complex relationships easier to see.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Venn Diagram Reasoning</h2><p>Practise different group and set based questions regularly to become more comfortable with visualising relationships and overlaps.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/reasoning/venn-diagram','Venn Diagram Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Practice Venn diagram and set based reasoning questions through online quizzes.',NULL,'Venn Diagram Questions & Quiz | Reasoning | QuizMitra','Test your Venn diagram reasoning skills with practice questions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:22:17','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(167,NULL,'Sports Quiz','स्पोर्ट्स क्विज़','sports-quiz',1,NULL,'fa fa-solid fa-trophy','Sports Quiz & Sports GK Questions | QuizMitra',NULL,'Test your sports knowledge with questions about cricket, football, tournaments, athletes, records and important sporting events.',NULL,'sports quiz, sports GK questions, cricket quiz, sports knowledge questions',NULL,'Sports Quiz & Sports GK Questions',NULL,'Test your knowledge of sports, athletes, teams, tournaments and memorable sporting events. Use these quizzes to revise sports-related general knowledge and challenge yourself with questions from different games.',NULL,'<h2>Test Your Sports Knowledge</h2>\r\n<p>Sports questions are a popular part of general awareness and current affairs preparation. They can cover major tournaments, athletes, teams, records, awards and important sporting events.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Explore Different Sports</h2>\r\n<p>Cricket and football are only part of sports knowledge. Explore questions from different games and competitions to build a broader understanding of national and international sports.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Sports in General Awareness</h2>\r\n<p>Competitive exams can include questions about major sporting events and achievements. Regular practice can help you remember important names, tournaments and records that may otherwise be easy to forget.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Keep Your Sports Knowledge Updated</h2>\r\n<p>Try different sports quizzes, review questions you missed and revisit important events during your preparation. Regular practice can strengthen both static sports knowledge and awareness of recent events.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/sports-quiz','Sports Quiz & Sports GK Questions | QuizMitra','Challenge yourself with sports questions covering cricket, football, tournaments, athletes and records.',NULL,'Sports Quiz & Sports GK Questions | QuizMitra','Test your knowledge of sports, players, tournaments and important sporting events.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 17:43:22','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(168,167,'Cricket','क्रिकेट','cricket',1,NULL,'fas fa-baseball-ball','Cricket Quiz & Questions | Cricket GK | QuizMitra',NULL,'Test your cricket knowledge with questions about players, teams, rules, records, tournaments and important cricket facts.',NULL,'cricket quiz, cricket questions, cricket GK, cricket trivia, cricket knowledge',NULL,'Cricket Quiz & Questions',NULL,'Test your cricket knowledge with questions covering players, teams, rules, records, tournaments and memorable moments from the game.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Cricket Quiz Questions</h2><p>Cricket has a long history with different formats, teams, tournaments and playing rules. Quiz practice is a simple way to test how much you remember about the sport.</p><h2>Players, Teams and Records</h2><p>Questions can cover famous players, international teams, cricket records, major tournaments, rules and important moments from the game.</p><h2>Learn More About Cricket</h2><p>Use quizzes to identify areas where your cricket knowledge is strong and topics that need another look. Reviewing the explanation after an incorrect answer can make the practice more useful.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Your Cricket Knowledge</h2><p>Try different cricket quizzes regularly and explore questions from players, tournaments, records and the rules of the game.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/sports-quiz/cricket','Cricket Quiz & Questions | Cricket GK | QuizMitra','Test your cricket knowledge with questions about players, teams, records, rules and tournaments.',NULL,'Cricket Quiz & Questions | Cricket GK | QuizMitra','Play cricket quizzes and test your knowledge of the game.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:23:51','2026-08-14 11:12:59','2026-08-21 15:43:39'),(169,167,'Indian Cricket','भारतीय क्रिकेट','indian-cricket',1,NULL,'fas fa-flag','Indian Cricket Quiz & Questions | Cricket GK | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice Indian cricket questions about Team India, players, tournaments, records and important moments in Indian cricket.',NULL,'Indian cricket quiz, Indian cricket questions, Team India quiz, Indian cricket GK',NULL,'Indian Cricket Quiz & Questions',NULL,'Explore Indian cricket through questions about Team India, players, tournaments, records and memorable moments in the history of Indian cricket.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Indian Cricket Questions</h2><p>Indian cricket has a rich history across international matches and major tournaments. Quiz questions can help fans revise important facts about the sport in India.</p><h2>Team India, Players and Tournaments</h2><p>Practice can include questions about Indian cricketers, national teams, major tournaments, records, captains and notable performances.</p><h2>Test Your Cricket Knowledge</h2><p>Use the quizzes to check what you remember and revisit explanations when an answer is unfamiliar.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Keep Exploring Indian Cricket</h2><p>Regular practice can help you remember important players, records, tournaments and milestones from Indian cricket.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/ca