pics.</p><h2>Improve Your Overall GK</h2><p>Review incorrect answers and explore the related topic after each test. A broad mix of subjects can make practice more challenging and useful.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Build Stronger General Knowledge</h2><p>Take regular GK mock tests and use your results to decide which topics need additional revision.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/mock-tests/general-knowledge-mock-test','General Knowledge Mock Test | GK Practice Test | QuizMitra','Take online GK mock tests covering India, world affairs, science, history, geography and sports.',NULL,'General Knowledge Mock Test | GK Practice Test | QuizMitra','Test your general knowledge with online GK practice tests.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,60,'2026-08-21 18:35:05','2026-08-14 11:13:01','2026-08-21 15:43:40'),(257,246,'English Mock Test','अंग्रेज़ी मॉक टेस्ट','english-mock-test',1,NULL,'fas fa-language','English Mock Test Online | English Practice Test | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice English mock tests online with questions on grammar, vocabulary, comprehension and other common exam topics.',NULL,'English mock test, English practice test, English online test, English grammar quiz, English exam questions',NULL,'English Mock Test Online',NULL,'Improve your English exam preparation with online mock tests covering grammar, vocabulary, comprehension and other common question types.',NULL,'<h2>Practice English Mock Tests</h2><p>English mock tests provide a useful way to practise grammar, vocabulary, comprehension and other language skills under timed conditions.</p><h2>Grammar, Vocabulary and Comprehension</h2><p>Regular practice can help identify common mistakes in sentence structure, word usage, reading comprehension and grammar rules.</p><h2>Improve Accuracy Through Review</h2><p>After each test, review incorrect answers and understand why the correct option works. This is more useful than simply checking your score.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Build Better English Exam Skills</h2><p>Regular practice with grammar, vocabulary and comprehension questions can improve accuracy and confidence.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/mock-tests/english-mock-test','English Mock Test Online | English Practice Test | QuizMitra','Practice English grammar, vocabulary and comprehension with online mock tests.',NULL,'English Mock Test Online | English Practice Test | QuizMitra','Take English practice tests online and improve your exam preparation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,60,'2026-08-21 18:35:05','2026-08-14 11:13:01','2026-08-21 15:43:40'),(258,246,'Computer Mock Test','कंप्यूटर मॉक टेस्ट','computer-mock-test',1,NULL,'fas fa-laptop','Computer Mock Test Online | Computer GK Practice | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice computer mock tests online with questions about hardware, software, internet, networking, operating systems and basic computer knowledge.',NULL,'computer mock test, computer GK mock test, computer practice test, computer questions, computer awareness quiz',NULL,'Computer Mock Test Online',NULL,'Test your computer knowledge with online mock tests covering hardware, software, internet, networking, operating systems and computer basics.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Computer Mock Tests</h2><p>Computer awareness is useful for many competitive examinations. Mock tests can help you revise common concepts and technical terminology.</p><h2>Hardware, Software and Internet</h2><p>Questions may cover computer hardware, software, operating systems, networking, internet concepts, security and basic digital terminology.</p><h2>Improve Computer Awareness</h2><p>Review explanations after each test and make a note of concepts that you frequently answer incorrectly.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Strengthen Your Computer GK</h2><p>Regular computer mock tests can help improve your familiarity with common computer awareness topics and terminology.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/mock-tests/computer-mock-test','Computer Mock Test Online | Computer GK Practice | QuizMitra','Practice computer awareness questions covering hardware, software, internet and networking.',NULL,'Computer Mock Test Online | Computer GK Practice | QuizMitra','Take computer mock tests online and improve your computer awareness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:35:05','2026-08-14 11:13:01','2026-08-21 15:43:40'),(259,246,'Mathematics Mock Test','गणित मॉक टेस्ट','mathematics-mock-test',1,NULL,'fas fa-calculator','Mathematics Mock Test Online | Maths Practice Test | QuizMitra',NULL,'Practice mathematics mock tests online with questions on arithmetic, algebra, percentages, ratios, geometry and other exam topics.',NULL,'mathematics mock test, maths mock test, maths practice test, mathematics questions, maths online test',NULL,'Mathematics Mock Test Online',NULL,'Improve your mathematics exam preparation with online mock tests covering arithmetic, algebra, percentages, ratios, geometry and other common topics.',NULL,'<h2>Practice Mathematics Mock Tests</h2><p>Timed mathematics practice can help improve calculation speed, accuracy and confidence. Mock tests provide a practical way to combine different topics.</p><h2>Arithmetic, Algebra and More</h2><p>Questions may include percentages, ratios, averages, profit and loss, number systems, algebra, geometry and other topics depending on the test.</p><h2>Learn From Your Mistakes</h2><p>Review the method used to solve incorrect questions instead of only checking the final answer. This can help improve problem-solving skills.</p>',NULL,'<h2>Improve Your Maths Speed and Accuracy</h2><p>Regular timed practice and careful review of mistakes can help you become more confident with exam-style mathematics questions.</p>',NULL,'https://quizmitra.com/category/mock-tests/mathematics-mock-test','Mathematics Mock Test Online | Maths Practice Test | QuizMitra','Practice mathematics questions online covering arithmetic, algebra, percentages, ratios and more.',NULL,'Mathematics Mock Test Online | Maths Practice Test | QuizMitra','Take maths mock tests online and improve speed and accuracy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,NULL,70,'2026-08-21 18:35:05','2026-08-14 11:13:01','2026-08-21 15:43:40');
