 and technology, sports, international relations and important national developments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>What You Will Practice</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>National Current Affairs</li>\r\n<li>International Current Affairs</li>\r\n<li>Economy and Banking Updates</li>\r\n<li>Government Schemes and Policies</li>\r\n<li>Science and Technology</li>\r\n<li>Defence and Security</li>\r\n<li>Sports Current Affairs</li>\r\n<li>Important Appointments and Developments</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Important Current Affairs of 25 August 2026</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Among the important developments covered around this date is the completion of 10 years of the Unified Payments Interface (UPI). UPI was launched on 25 August 2016 and has become a major part of India\'s real-time digital payments ecosystem.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Other important topics include India\'s diplomatic and strategic engagements, developments in the sports ecosystem, government policy initiatives, infrastructure projects, financial developments and emerging technology.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Why Practice Daily Current Affairs?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Regular current affairs practice helps competitive-exam aspirants improve their awareness of important national and international events. Solving MCQs also helps you revise facts quickly and identify topics that need further preparation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Challenge yourself with all 30 questions and check your score at the end.</strong></p>',NULL,NULL,'Daily Current Affairs Quiz â€“ 25 August 2026','Attempt 30 important Daily Current Affairs MCQs from 25 August 2026 covering national, international, economy, science, defence and sports updates.',NULL,'Daily Current Affairs Quiz â€“ 25 August 2026','Can you score 30/30? Test your knowledge with today\'s important Current Affairs MCQs for SSC, Banking, Railway, UPSC and other competitive exams.',1,1,'{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Quiz\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Daily Current Affairs Quiz â€“ 25 August 2026\",\r\n  \"description\"