hed?',NULL,'The United Nations was established in 1945 after the Second World War.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9354,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2340,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','On which date is United Nations Day observed each year?',NULL,'United Nations Day is observed on 24 October, the anniversary of the UN Charter entering into force.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9359,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2341,202,207,'mcq_single','medium','How many original member states signed the UN Charter in 1945?',NULL,'Fifty countries signed the UN Charter in San Francisco in 1945; Poland signed later and became the 51st original member.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9364,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2342,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','How many member states does the United Nations currently have?',NULL,'The United Nations currently has 193 member states.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9365,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2343,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which document established the United Nations?',NULL,'The United Nations Charter is the founding treaty of the United Nations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9370,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2344,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Where was the UN Charter signed in 1945?',NULL,'The UN Charter was signed in San Francisco on 26 June 1945.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9375,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2345,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','When did the UN Charter enter into force?',NULL,'The UN Charter entered into force on 24 October 1945.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9380,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2346,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which body is the principal judicial organ of the United Nations?',NULL,'The International Court of Justice is the principal judicial organ of the United Nations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9381,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2347,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Where is the International Court 