al Assembly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9413,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2355,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Who is the chief administrative officer of the United Nations?',NULL,'The Secretary-General serves as the chief administrative officer of the United Nations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9418,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2356,202,207,'mcq_single','medium','Who appoints the UN Secretary-General?',NULL,'The General Assembly appoints the Secretary-General following a recommendation from the Security Council.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9423,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2357,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What is the normal term of office of the UN Secretary-General?',NULL,'The Secretary-General is normally appointed for a five-year term, which may be renewed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9428,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2358,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Who was the first Secretary-General of the United Nations?',NULL,'Trygve Lie of Norway was the first UN Secretary-General.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9429,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2359,202,207,'mcq_single','medium','Who was the first woman to serve as President of the UN General Assembly?',NULL,'Vijaya Lakshmi Pandit of India became the first woman President of the UN General Assembly in 1953.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9434,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2360,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN body is responsible for coordinating economic and social work?',NULL,'The Economic and Social Council, or ECOSOC, coordinates the UN\'s economic and social work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9439,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2361,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','How many members does ECOSOC have?',NULL,'ECOSOC consists of 54 member states elected by the General Assembly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9444,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2362,202,207,'mcq_single','medium','Which UN organ suspended its operations in 1994 after Palau became independent?',NULL,'The Trusteeship Council suspended operations in 1994 after the independence of Palau, the last UN trust territory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9445,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2363,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN organ is composed of international civil servants?',NULL,'The Secretariat is the UN\'s administrative body and is staffed by international civil servants.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9450,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2364,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN agency is responsible for international public health?',NULL,'The World Health Organization is the UN specialized agency responsible for international public health.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9455,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2365,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What does WHO stand for?',NULL,'WHO stands for World Health Organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9460,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2366,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN agency focuses on education, science and culture?',NULL,'UNESCO works in education, science, culture and related fields.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9461,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2367,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What does UNESCO stand for?',NULL,'UNESCO stands for United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9466,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2368,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN agency works primarily for children?',NULL,'UNICEF is the United Nations agency focused on children and their rights and well-being.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9471,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2369,202,207,'mcq_single','medium','What does UNICEF originally stand for?',NULL,'UNICEF originated as the United Nations International Children\'s Emergency Fund.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9476,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2370,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN body protects and assists refugees worldwide?',NULL,'UNHCR is the UN Refugee Agency, mandated to protect and assist refugees and other displaced people.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9477,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2371,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What does UNHCR stand for?',NULL,'UNHCR stands for United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9482,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2372,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN agency deals with food and agriculture?',NULL,'FAO is the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9487,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2373,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What does FAO stand for?',NULL,'FAO stands for Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9492,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2374,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN agency promotes decent work and labor standards?',NULL,'The International Labour Organization promotes labor rights, decent work and international labor standards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9493,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:44'),(2375,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What does ILO stand for?',NULL,'ILO stands for International Labour Organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9498,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:44','2026-08-14 08:55:45'),(2376,202,207,'mcq_single','medium','Which UN agency focuses on industrial development?',NULL,'UNIDO promotes inclusive and sustainable industrial development.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9503,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:45','2026-08-14 08:55:45'),(2377,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','What does UNIDO stand for?',NULL,'UNIDO stands for United Nations Industrial Development Organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,9508,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 08:55:45','2026-08-14 08:55:45'),(2378,202,207,'mcq_single','easy','Which UN programme focuses on development and poverty reduction?',NULL,'UNDP works on development, poverty r