,NULL,'The CPU executes instructions and performs the main processing tasks of a computer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19843,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4963,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','Which device is primarily used to enter text into a computer?',NULL,'A keyboard is an input device designed mainly for entering text and commands.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19847,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4964,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','Which device displays visual output from a computer?',NULL,'A monitor displays text, images, and other visual output from the computer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19851,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4965,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','What is the full form of CPU?',NULL,'CPU stands for Central Processing Unit, the main processor of a computer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19855,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4966,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','Which part of a computer stores data permanently?',NULL,'A hard drive provides non-volatile storage for data and files.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19859,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4967,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','Which memory loses its contents when power is turned off?',NULL,'RAM is volatile memory, so its contents are normally lost when power is removed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19863,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4968,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','Which device is used to move the pointer on a computer screen?',NULL,'A mouse is a pointing input device used to control the on-screen pointer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19867,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4969,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','What does RAM stand for?',NULL,'RAM stands for Random Access Memory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,1.00,19871,1,NULL,'2026-08-14 10:40:36','2026-08-14 10:40:36'),(4970,51,69,'mcq_single','medium','Which device produces sound from a computer?',NULL,'Speakers convert computer audio signals into audible sound.',NULL,NULL,N